cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the computer-assisted preprint in preferred-citation below and
  identify the repository version used. This file describes release v1.1.0.
title: "Exact certificate and reproducibility package for a contact-geometric MinVol bound"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
repository-code: "https://github.com/swihart/minvol-degree3-contact-bound"
url: "https://github.com/swihart/minvol-degree3-contact-bound/releases/tag/v1.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Swihart"
    given-names: "Bruce J."
abstract: >-
  Standalone exact-rational certificate, manuscript, independent Python and
  base-R audits, adversarial tests, and reproducibility materials for a
  proposed universal contact-geometric lower bound in the three-dimensional
  Blaschke-Lebesgue problem. The package is AI-assisted, non-peer-reviewed,
  and seeks independent mathematical verification.
keywords:
  - "bodies of constant width"
  - "Blaschke-Lebesgue problem"
  - "convex geometry"
  - "computer-assisted proof"
  - "exact rational arithmetic"
  - "reproducible research"
